A||N||28||AusFiero||Stage 2 Body Kit - Rear Fastback View||||1||
Z||000000||AusFiero||07-25-2001||12:39 PM||||Well I know it has been a long time getting there, and the coupe version is coming soon.<BR>The car I am working on arrives in about 3 weeks to develop the project.<BR>So here is the rear view. Lower grills are actually recessed more, hard to show. Exhaust is still negotiable and this is the lip spoilered version not the new rear winged version. The Pontiac in the middle will light up like original and will be available in red or clear. Maybe orange also.<P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/stage2rear01.jpg">  <BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/stage2rear02.jpg">  <BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/stage2rear03.jpg">  <P><BR>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/ausfiero1.gif">  <BR><A HREF="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero</A> | <A HREF="http://www.auto-alley.com" TARGET=_blank>Fiero Accessories</A><p>[This message has been edited by AusFiero (edited 07-25-2001).]||202.139.20.3||reg||1
Z||000001||MooCow||07-25-2001||12:44 PM||||I like it.  So how do we put it on??  Looks like we would need a whole new Decklid?<BR>Whatever you do don't push yourself just because you are feeling better.  Don't want you gone to long cause I want to see what you have in store for us.  Keep up the great work Aus.<P>Thanks Ken||||reg||10
Z||000002||AusFiero||07-25-2001||12:56 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by MooCow:<BR><B>I like it.  So how do we put it on??  Looks like we would need a whole new Decklid?<BR>Thanks Ken</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Nope no new decklid, the lip spoiler takes care of that by wraping down lower over the rear. Lower bumper section is a cover and the tail lights will be a bolt in.<P>All designed for economy as the rest of the kit has been.<P>||||reg||1
Z||000003||Shaft||07-25-2001||02:23 PM||||I LOVE THE SKYLINE LOOK! Aus, I can't wait till you have some of this done.||||reg||10
Z||000004||Monkeyman||07-25-2001||05:29 PM||||Aus--What are you going to do for those of us who may want to retain the stock wing?  Will you have another piece that covers the rear of the decklid?  Your discription last night didn't do that car justice.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  Wow!  I'll be 1st in line.  Hmmm...What can I sell to get some money?  Anyone need 1/2 a liver?<P>------------------<BR>'Consciousness:  That annoying time between naps.'<P>MM||||reg||1
