Z||000008||AusFiero||07-25-2001||06:57 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Monkeyman:<BR><B>Aus--What are you going to do for those of us who may want to retain the stock wing?  </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>There will be a section available MM that will have to be glassed into you existing deck lid as I also have another version yet which has a different rear wing to a Fiero. That will involve a but of work to fit but will be strong and not crack if glassed in properly. Unfortunately not a bolt on in that case but it will be easy to do by anyone with basic fibreglassing knowledge.<P>oh love the liver comment after talking on the phone yesterday mate  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/ausfiero1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero</A> | <A HREF="http://www.auto-alley.com" TARGET=_blank>Fiero Accessories</A>||202.139.20.3||reg||1
Z||000009||AusFiero||07-25-2001||06:58 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Shaft:<BR><B>I LOVE THE SKYLINE LOOK! Aus, I can't wait till you have some of this done.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Ahhh a man in the know. Skyline was the only tail lights I could get the right sizes  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/ausfiero1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero</A> | <A HREF="http://www.auto-alley.com" TARGET=_blank>Fiero Accessories</A>||202.139.20.3||reg||1
Z||000010||MikeSchaefer||07-25-2001||10:09 PM||||Beautifully done Aus!  I love how modern it looks, while still complimenting the natural lines of the car.  Most kits just try and round everything out and I think they miss the natural good looks of the Fiero.  Your kit seems to highlight and update our the car, very very good work!<BR>Mike Schaefer <A HREF="http://surf.to/fiero" TARGET=_blank>http://surf.to/fiero</A> ||||reg||6
